# Documentation only. The application deliberately does not load dotenv files.
# DO NOT insert real API keys here or in any repository/candidate workspace.
# An independently approved trusted controller must inject its low-limit key
# outside this agent session; no environment switch unlocks Live in this baseline.
AT_M0_PRIVATE_EVAL_DIR=/absolute/outside/repository/private-eval
# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY is intentionally absent.
